OL,4,CBadenoch challenges Burnham over       
OL,5,Cuniversity fees for EU students        
OL,6,GConservative leader Kemi Badenoch has  
OL,7,Gchallenged Andy Burnham over whether   
OL,8,GEU students in the UK could pay lower  
OL,9,Guniversity tuition fees as part of his 
OL,10,Gdeal with the bloc.                    
OL,12,FThe prime minister insisted the issue  
OL,13,Fof tuition fees was "a separate deal", 
OL,14,Fwith discussions on this continuing.   
OL,16,FAsked whether he could rule out EU     
OL,17,Fstudents paying the same fees as       
OL,18,FBritish students, Burnham said this    
OL,19,Fwas "the European negotiating          
OL,20,Fposition" and "won't be put on the     
OL,21,Ftable".                                
